<title>USA: Staffmark sees Advantage boosting 97 EPS.</title>
<headline>Staffmark sees Advantage boosting 97 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>FAYETVILLE, Ark. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversifed personnel staffing company StaffMark Inc said on Wednesday it expected its acquisition of Chandler Enterprises d/b/a Advantage Staffing would help 1997 earnings.</p>
<p>The company said it had completed its acquisition of the South Carolina-based staffing company, and the deal would be accounted for as an asset purchase.</p>
<p>The unaudited revenues for Advantage Staffing for fiscal 1996 were expected to be approximately $3.5 million, StaffMark said. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
